abstract: >-
  Code, evaluation corpus and raw model outputs for an edge-native semantic firewall: a
  3.8B-parameter Phi-3-mini model, 4-bit quantized and held under a 4.2 GiB VRAM ceiling,
  occupying the evaluator stage of a Generator-Evaluator pipeline on a single consumer
  laptop. A structured Chain-of-Thought JSON schema requires the evaluator to name the
  governing policy rule and justify the match before emitting a decision.
keywords:
  - agentic AI security
  - edge inference
  - semantic verification
  - Chain-of-Thought prompting
  - prompt injection
  - data sovereignty
